Select → Region: Store / Retrieve selection (with playhead)

Restores Audacity 3.x-style Select → Region → Store Selection / Retrieve
Selection for Audacity 4. Also bookmarks and restores the playhead so the
cursor returns with the time range.

Touches:
  - trackedit commands, registration, and actions controller
  - Select → Region menu items
  - orphaned sel-save / sel-restore shortcuts
  - unit tests for store/retrieve including playhead seek

Apply against an Audacity 4.x tree:
  git apply 0001-select-region-store-retrieve-selection-and-playhead.patch

